## Font Loading Optimization

### Pattern: Font Strategies

```astro
---
// ✅ Good: Preload critical fonts
// ✅ Good: Use system fonts as fallback
---

<!-- Preload only critical font weights -->
<link
  rel="preload"
  href="/fonts/inter-400.woff2"
  as="font"
  type="font/woff2"
  crossorigin
/>

<!-- Font-display: swap for better LCP -->
<style>
  @font-face {
    font-family: 'Inter';
    src: url('/fonts/inter-400.woff2') format('woff2');
    font-display: swap;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  body {
    /* ✅ Good: System fonts fallback */
    font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto;
  }
</style>
```

