## Build Performance Monitoring

### Performance Targets

| Metric | Target | Impact |
|--------|--------|--------|
| **Build Time** | < 60s | Development experience |
| **HTML Size** | < 50KB | Network transfer |
| **JS Bundle** | < 100KB | Core Web Vitals |
| **CSS Bundle** | < 20KB | Paint timing |
| **Total HTML** | < 200KB | Mobile speed |

## Build Optimization Checklist

- [ ] Output is static (not on-demand SSR)
- [ ] HTML compression enabled
- [ ] CSS/JS minification active
- [ ] Image optimization configured
- [ ] Unused CSS purged via Tailwind
- [ ] Service worker optional (if offline needed)
- [ ] Critical fonts preloaded
- [ ] Font-display: swap used
- [ ] Code splitting with dynamic imports
- [ ] No synchronous scripts in head
- [ ] Preload critical resources
- [ ] DNS prefetch for external domains
- [ ] Gzip/Brotli compression enabled on server
- [ ] Cache headers configured
- [ ] CDN in use for static assets

